# License

This repository contains two kinds of content, under different terms.

## 1. Images and ground-truth masks (`images/`, `masks/`)

**Not** original to this repository. They come from 3DOI (*Understanding 3D Object Interaction from a Single Image*, Qian & Fouhey, ICCV 2023), which collected its images from EpicKitchens and Omnidata.

The EpicKitchens dataset and benchmark are released under the **Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC 4.0)**:

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

Using these images and masks therefore requires:

- **Attribution** — credit EpicKitchens / Omnidata as the source, obtained via 3DOI;
- **License link** — include the CC BY-NC 4.0 link above;
- **Indication of changes** — this repository does not modify the images or masks (see `NOTICE`);
- **Non-commercial** — no commercial use.

The Omnidata portion is additionally subject to its own original license.

## 2. Audit and revision (`tasks.jsonl`, `review_log.jsonl`, `README.md`, `LICENSE`, `NOTICE`)

The instruction audit and revision work in this repository — the rewritten instruction text, the keep / edit / reject verdicts and their record — is released under **CC BY-NC 4.0**, on the terms above.

